# Railway start command (Root Directory for this service must be set to
# "backend" in Railway's dashboard Settings -> Source -> Root Directory,
# since this is a single repo with both backend/ and frontend/).
#
# --proxy-headers is required for slowapi's per-IP rate limiting
# (app/core/rate_limit.py) to see the real client IP -- Railway's edge
# proxies every request, so without this flag every request looks like
# it comes from the same proxy IP, silently turning "5 requests per
# client" into "5 requests total for every user combined."
web: uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT --proxy-headers
